		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2025-04-30T22:29:50Z",
			"File": [
				"⡇⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				166,
				15
			],
			"Message": "This commit introduces several significant changes across the project infrastructure and core functionality:\n\n1. **Local Tauri Dependency**: Changed the Tauri dependency from a version-based reference to a local path (../../Dependency/Tauri/...), indicating a shift to using a modified or development version of Tauri for enhanced control or testing purposes.\n\n2. **Structured Logging Implementation**: Added env_logger, log, and colored crates to implement color-coded logging with custom formatting. Log messages now display:\n   - Application name (\"Mountain\") in red\n   - Log levels color-coded (ERROR=red, WARN=yellow, etc.)\n   - Improved error message for logger initialization failures\n\n3. **CSS Loading Workflow**: Added web resource request interception logic that:\n   - Detects CSS file requests\n   - Allows bypassing interception via \"Skip=Intercept\" query parameter\n   - Replaces CSS content with JavaScript worker loading logic when not skipped\n   - Modifies response headers to prevent caching issues\n\n4. **Code Quality Improvements**:\n   - Renamed variables for clarity (Build → Builder, Application → Builder)\n   - Enhanced error handling in window creation with explicit panic messages\n   - Removed debug println!(\"Opening DevTools\") statement\n\n5. **Project Cleanup**:\n   - Removed Android IDE configuration files (.idea/*)\n   - Modified gradlew script comment for accuracy\n\n6. **Permission Schema Adjustments**:\n   - Removed webview_auto_resize permissions from Android/mobile schemas\n   - Added webview_auto_resize permissions to desktop/Windows schemas\n   - Maintained consistent permission structures across platform definitions",
			"SHA": "07f47e7fdaa3a724156022e5cb104cd07593cda0"
		},
